Package: siteOptiSample
Title: Optimal Placement of Forest Plots in Structural Space
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("John L.", "Godlee", , "johngodlee@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to assess how well existing forest plots represent the
    structural variation of a landscape, and to select locations for new plots
    that fill gaps in multidimensional structural space. Works with raster
    datasets (e.g. airborne LiDAR metrics) or tabular data, and provides
    several plot selection algorithms (meanmin, minimax, K-means, and Latin
    hypercube).
